START

Declare three integer variables: a, b, c
Ask the user to enter three integers
Store the inputs into a, b, c

Create three integer pointers using dynamic memory:
    p1 = new int
    p2 = new int
    p3 = new int

Store the values of a, b, c into the memory pointed to by p1, p2, p3

Display:
    The values of a, b, c
    The values stored in *p1, *p2, *p3
    The memory addresses stored in p1, p2, p3

Use delete to free the dynamic memory:
    delete p1
    delete p2
    delete p3

Set pointers to nullptr

END
